  "body": "## What changed\n\nDocument the optional operation `notes` array in MCP `generate` and `verify` replies.\nExplain when the field is omitted and how informational notes differ from blocking warnings.\nDescribe both band and corner checks in the `unreached.rs` module comment.\nRecord the remaining module-size debt and the decision to keep stock-outline selection in the generation dispatcher.\nThe issue accepts a recorded decision for each owed item.\nNeither overlength module was split.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe public descriptions did not cover the operation notes and corner check added by #2503.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe documentation pins are `test_generate_and_verify_document_optional_operation_notes` and `test_unreached_module_documents_bands_and_stock_corners`.\nBoth failed before the documentation edits and pass after them.\nRestoring each exact upstream file independently makes its pin fail.\nRestoring each fixed file makes its pin pass.\nAll three MCP skill Python tests pass.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passes on the stable final tree.\nThe motion suite passes 434 tests and ignores 10 heavy tests.\nThe mapped `adaptive_zero_margin_island` suite passes all four tests.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings` passes.\nThe inherited sccache wrapper stalled the initial attempt.\nThe completed checks unset `RUSTC_WRAPPER` and set `CAMCRAFT_NO_SCCACHE=1` in their shell.\nAn earlier gate was void because generated Python cache cleanup changed an untracked entry during that run.\nThe full gate was rerun without any tree changes and passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\nThe `.nc` and `.cl` diff is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo physical machine or GUI session was exercised.\nThis change edits documentation and its contract tests.\nThe generation and script modules remain over the line limit as recorded in the decision file.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPRs #2253, #2149, #2134 and #2092 touch the same MCP skill file, different tool entries; whichever merges second refreshes.\nNone changes the `generate` or `verify` entry.\n\nProcess change: yes\nEffort: low\nChangelog: none (documentation and contract tests only)\n\nFixes #2512\n",
